# sabotage=PassesDropCalls behind a pass over the whole program: a call of an unknown function is gone. The pass expands the yields that save a frame, and answers for those alone: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass MoveGeneratorFramesToHeap
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-left-alone.ir
